    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is the difference between GEO and AEO?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Mostly vocabulary drawing boundaries around the same work: AEO (answer engine optimisation) usually refers to structuring content for direct-answer surfaces, GEO to visibility inside generative responses broadly. The mechanics cover both, and no buyer decision should hinge on the acronym." }
