      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, and the dependency runs one way: AI engines source answers through search retrieval, so SEO is the substrate GEO sits on. A sensible programme keeps the SEO foundation for retrievability, makes every page extractable, builds earned citations in independent sources, and measures at the prompt level against a baseline." }
    },
  ]
